# third_party

## Purpose
Reference/vendor material that is not authoritative LumiNet product source.

## Contents
- `gaio/` preserves an external gaio source snapshot used for provenance/reference only.

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Live code must not import this tree unless a dedicated adoption decision explicitly promotes a dependency into the product graph.

## Invariants
- `third_party/` remains outside `src/` so reference bytes cannot masquerade as shipped ownership.
- Preserve upstream provenance and avoid local architectural edits inside vendored snapshots.
